{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10133170","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10133170","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1013317001:1":{"text":"真热闹啊。这片遗址可难得见到这么多活人。","source_cn":"真热闹啊。这片遗址可难得见到这么多活人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAE0492FF0247F4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013317002:2":{"text":"阿塔兰忒……又见面了！你竟然从薄暮丛林离开了？","source_cn":"阿塔兰忒……又见面了！你竟然从薄暮丛林离开了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB3C429606B2DBC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1013317003:2":{"text":"在这种荒山野岭都能遇到朋友？<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，你的人脉之广还真令我意外。","source_cn":"在这种荒山野岭都能遇到朋友？<style=stress...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x05C0AE94783D0357","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"在这种荒山野岭都能遇到朋友？<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，你的人脉之广还真令我意外。","female":"在这种荒山野岭都能遇到朋友？<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，你的人脉之广还真令我意外。","variant_male_record_index":"115951","variant_female_record_index":"115952","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1013317004:2":{"text":"……你为什么会在这里！","source_cn":"……你为什么会在这里！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E20DD0388FB2687","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1013317005:2":{"text":"你们在这里干嘛？","source_cn":"你们在这里干嘛？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x650D5B14ABA57297","variant_status":"","male":"